      ],
      "text": "A deployment runs three application workloads: core, web-ui (chat plus admin under /admin), and portal, which is the public entry point and hosts the optional built-in auth broker; Slack stays in core."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_1d5847e861a37f4714dd5d00d846e7b7da4cd4e41e6f7fa42521b4556afb6dac",
