        "slc_1fe59d64902e00954e73378234d1630d8187ea03c215ee6f5f35354306126547"
      ],
      "text": "The core runs TypeScript directly on Node with Fastify for HTTP; the Slack plugin uses Bolt, and the web UI builds with Vite and renders with Lit."
    },
