      ],
      "text": "Published apps receive AGENT_API_URL and AGENT_CREDENTIAL_TOKEN and call $AGENT_API_URL/v1/credentials/broker with the token in x-agent-capability, authorizing as the immutable publisher rather than the viewing person."
    },
