  "summary": "QM is a multiplayer agent harness deployable to Slack and web, with per-scope workspaces, a headless TypeScript core on Node/Fastify backed by Postgres, and a versioned deployment-directory contract driven by the `qm` CLI. Evidence covers architecture, security postures, deployment tooling, and admin model verification; no eval harness or contributor test instructions appear in the slices. Evidence coverage: 96 of 108 packet slices were shown to the model; the rest were withheld by the prompt budget.",
